  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f7f100ca5acb80e419fb880c74681589, type: 3}
  m_Name: taurus talk
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueList:
  - Ugh. I can't stand that Taurus guy.
  - He thinks he's so cool just because he has hands.
  - He's all like 'I've got hands! I can touch things!'
  - Well, guess what chump? Neither of us have legs.
  - What good are your hands when you're stuck in the ground?
  - Hate that guy.
  - Don't pray at his shrine. It'll just go to his head.
  sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1d92954ab6270cf42beff35668c0d5fb, type: 3}
